<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Feb 14.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Feb 14.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali looks at telecommunications projects and examines policy to boost use of computers.</p>
<p>- New fiscal code to be set up this year.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Transport and agriculture authorities discuss ways to improve freight traffic to boost food exports.</p>
<p>LE RENOUVEAU</p>
<p>- Olive oil output for the season 1996/1997 put at 250,000 tonnes.</p>
</text>
